# Line-coverage floor, in percent. Read by CI and by Tools/Tasks.cs, so the gate a developer runs
# locally is the gate CI runs. One value, one file, no second copy to drift.
#
# Set from measurement, never invented: a few points under the measured value, so an honest refactor
# has room and a real regression trips it. Measure with Docker present — both integration suites
# contribute — and in Debug, the lower figure, before moving the number; rows measured differently
# do not compare.
90
